      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "minato.liberation.asset.sprite.character",
        "actorId": "minato",
        "slot": "right",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夜のカフェ。机の上には二枚の紙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "契約解除届と、まっさらな依頼票。今日でミナトは、誰の依頼も背負わない人になる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1vz3er0",
      "speakerName": "ミナト",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "解除の書類は、三十秒で読み終えた。……問題は、こっちの白い方だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "それは、おまけです。書いても書かなくてもいい、ただの依頼票。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "解除の判は、あっけなく押された。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "四十八件の依頼を終えた人の契約が、レシートみたいに軽く終わる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼はしばらく、白い依頼票を見つめていた。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1vz3er0",
      "speakerName": "ミナト",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "依頼人の欄に、自分の名前を書くのは……ありなのか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "ありです。うちの窓口、書式にはうるさいですけど、そこは自由です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "依頼内容——「次の試合に、俺として出る」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "世界で一番小さくて、一番時間のかかった依頼だった。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1vz3er0",
      "speakerName": "ミナト",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "報酬欄は、どうする。自分への依頼だと、払うのも俺だが。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "じゃあ、勝っても負けても、試合のあとに日替わり定食。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "私がおごります。半分こじゃなくて、一人前ずつ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1vz3er0",
      "speakerName": "ミナト",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……一人前ずつ、か。半分こも、悪くなかったが。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ぼそっと言われた一言に、水を出す手が滑りかけた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳は先に赤くなってた。この人は無自覚で言うから、性質が悪い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.011c",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.011c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "報酬欄には結局、「日替わり定食(相談の上、半分こ可)」と書かれた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.011d",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.011d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "書式にうるさい窓口として、括弧の但し書きは満点だった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰り際、彼は預けてあった花柄の短剣を受け取りに来なかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.012b",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.012b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「まだ預かっていてくれ。呼び戻す係は、続投だ」自由になった人の最初の人事が、それだった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "minato.liberation.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "白い依頼票の綴りは、まだ何十枚も残っている。これからの分だ。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "minato.liberation.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "minato.liberation.choice.001",
          "label": "返却済みの契約書と、未記入の依頼票を並べる",
          "result": "「四十八件は、人に頼まれた物語。ここから先は、自分に頼む物語」二つの束を並べて写真に撮った(記録係の職業病)。「白紙って、こんなに眩しいものだったか」と彼は言った。",
          "intent": "終わった依頼と、これからの依頼を分けて見せる",
          "promise": "所有者名を消し、本人が自分の名で次の試合を選べるようにする。",
          "memory": "白紙を眩しいと言った夜のことを、二人とも覚えている。",
          "tone": "defiant",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "minato"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 10,
              "ownership": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "liberationDecision",
              "fighterId": "minato",
              "decision": "release"
            }
          ],
          "goto": "minato.liberation.node.effect.001"
        },
        {
          "id": "minato.liberation.choice.002",
          "label": "契約を解いたあと、四十八件目を仲間として頼む",
          "result": "「契約じゃなくて、仲間としてのお願いです。決勝、一緒に戦ってください」ミナトは即答した。一秒だった。「即決できるとはな」本人がいちばん驚いていた。",
          "intent": "自由な相手へ、改めて隣を頼む",
          "promise": "断る権利を返したうえで、決勝を一緒に戦う新しい約束を結ぶ。",
          "memory": "四十八件目だけ即答だったことを、チームの全員がからかい、全員が喜んだ。",
          "tone": "tender",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "minato"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 6,
              "ownership": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "sharedPoints",
              "amount": 4
            },
            {
              "type": "liberationDecision",
              "fighterId": "minato",
              "decision": "release"
            }
          ],
          "goto": "minato.liberation.node.effect.001"
        }
      ]
    },
